OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMainly dry
OL,6,Fthis evening with just the odd light
OL,7,Fshower. Then the rest of the night
OL,8,Fwill be largely dry with some lengthy
OL,9,Fclear periods.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FAll parts will have a dry day
OL,12,Fwith some sunshine but high cloud
OL,13,Fspilling east later.
OL,14,
OL,15,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FDry
OL,16,Fon Tuesday but rain spreading north,
OL,17,Fwindy with east coast gales later.
OL,18,FSunny spells and a few showers on
OL,19,FWednesday. Mostly dry and bright on
OL,20,FThursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
